getExitList [SimTalk]
Returns the contents of the internal exit list of the FlowControl designated by <Path> for the setting Exit
Strategy > Percentage or Cyclic Sequence, and writes it to a list.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>.getExitList(ExitList:any) → boolean
Parameter
The parameter ExitList of data type any designates the name of the list.
Return Value
The return value has the data type boolean.
Example
MyFlowControl.getExitList(DataList)
MyFlowControl.setExitList(DataList.copy)
SimTalk
setExitList [SimTalk]
See also
Percentage [FlowControl, exit]
Cyclic Sequence [FlowControl, entry]
