setEntryList [SimTalk]
Sets the entry list of the FlowControl designated by <Path> for the setting Entry Strategy > Percentage or
Cyclic Sequence.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>.setEntryList(EntryList:any)
Parameter
The parameter EntryList of data type any designates the path to a list or a variable of the same data type.
Plant Simulation then copies the contents of the passed list to the internal entry list of the FlowControl.
Example
MyFlowControl.setEntryList(DataList)
MyFlowControl.setEntryList(DataList.copy)
SimTalk
getEntryList [SimTalk]
See also
Cyclic Sequence [FlowControl, entry]
Percentage [FlowControl, entry]
